# Root forensics archive

Historical audit / health / readiness reports moved off the monorepo root so
the root stays limited to product entrypoints (`README.md`, `AGENTS.md`,
tooling configs).

## Rules

1. **Immutable.** Edit only to repair links after further archive moves.
2. **Not live SoT.** Open work belongs in phase docs, MAP, or `docs/audits/`.
3. **Inbound links** from active docs may point here for history.

## Inventory

See filenames in this directory (enterprise audit, system health, phase-0/3 red
flags, phase-3 readiness/final reports, token drift, architecture reviews).
